{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_title", "source_sha256": "6bf15a21df80da1594a5c071454bacc386c7cf3fd4a417b820723bb9f7be3844", "ja": "IDOL WORLD SUPER FESTIVAL DAY2 留守電", "zh": "IDOL WORLD SUPER FESTIVAL DAY2 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "568eec73d73c80f29822abba53016002cc7d988148e8b7c216c3e716a35fb76a", "ja": "IDOL WORLD SUPER FESTIVAL\n2026 -ZESSYOU- を無事に終えた\n静香からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是顺利结束了\nIDOL WORLD SUPER FESTIVAL\n2026 -ZESSYOU- 的\n静香发来的电话留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "4187380d0851b5af2ed6222acd6235e24bf999b51cb6a36c20c554ad9ec0c0bf", "ja": "えっと……お疲れ様です、{$P$}。\n最上静香です。", "zh": "呃……辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n我是最上静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "d38d548a618e5556873d654ef27a0c5be3112eeb378fd2931f116544c76b584e", "ja": "まだ明日の準備で忙しいですよね。ステージ裏の\nスタッフさん達も、みんな忙しそうでした。", "zh": "您还在忙着准备明天的事情吧。舞台后台的工作人员们看起来也都很忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "ea3c93e77f105c96cf4c1944cafefd799b6bce55dbf7cb8bdd12e7a0d566d9de", "ja": "その……大丈夫ですか？　他の事務所のプロデューサー\nさん達に迷惑かけたり、してないですよね？", "zh": "那个……您还好吗？没有给其他事务所的制作人们添麻烦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "f069e6b1a38372b59516b1e59268922b4704eb6eb703245276fa77093db3bd3c", "ja": "もちろん、今日の準備もバッチリだったし、\n心配はしてませんけど……念のため。一応。", "zh": "当然，今天的准备也很充分，\n我并不是在担心您……只是以防万一。确认一下而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "1ab6b8047e4ff8427cace2d70bfc2ba8afbcf45c21c2189db4482311692744e3", "ja": "って、別にこんなこと言いたかったわけじゃ\nないんです。……コホン。", "zh": "我也不是想说这种话  \n……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "a04fcd5366ea63e0ff54b06be2beda979b3af2032e00e6b1aa979c6b2f1cd3dd", "ja": "{$P$}。\n今日のライブ、本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n真的非常感谢您今天来看演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "150e78cf9ff94bbbdfd1798b91c816ba95938b6d6e3d51f9f0c803f4dcda6505", "ja": "ステージからこんなにも、歌を……\n音楽への想いそのものを、届けることができるなんて。", "zh": "没想到能从舞台上，将歌声……\n将对音乐的心意本身，传递给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "5bfad7e9c5c36fc13bb930a9fbcfc4197f7668e79485525aa0d441568573fb9d", "ja": "なんだか、夢がかなったっていうか……。\n自分でも笑っちゃうくらい、嬉しかったです。", "zh": "总觉得，就像梦想实现了一样……开心得连自己都忍不住笑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "6f0c44efbd4117eaa29c4cbb2d83424bc73e712f86628a976759b11932392173", "ja": "しかも千早さんもいて、ジュリアさんも、あずささんも\nいて……やっぱりすごくて、きれいで……。", "zh": "而且千早小姐也在，茱莉亚先生也在，梓小姐也在……果然都非常厉害，又漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "1f81e0b3cff4ef3298ad97a229511b496ac6fd9ba3a1c4e4efdb39df4210938a", "ja": "でも他の事務所のみなさんも、本当にすごくて。\nもちろん、ライバルでもあるんですけど。", "zh": "不过其他事务所的各位也真的很厉害。\n当然，她们也是我们的对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "55beea3eec97094f6254dd8b0f547ea47cb1e302bc79b0e796dfed1848693370", "ja": "それは千早さんたちも同じなんです。", "zh": "千早前辈她们也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab30cb484922e1d1b7a47bdd0c9d74de42cc3d8700f1a649b68742cee6c1268d", "ja": "『全力でぶつかれて、背中を預けられる仲間』……\nそんな皆さんとのライブだったなって、思いました。", "zh": "『能够全力以赴地并肩作战、可以把后背交给对方的伙伴』……\n我觉得，这就是和这样的大家一起举办的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "4ff5bc57e8d2551cc866d52875cf6356ec1b11749c7717d1aedd8a98fa83e8f0", "ja": "私のことも、そんな風に思ってもらえてると\nいいんですけど……怖いから、聞かないでおきます。", "zh": "要是你们也能这样看待我就好了……\n不过我害怕，所以还是不问了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "76e0a8cebdfe76e1edbff715a0b200cc343e510b78d28d6bd4edc66525825b16", "ja": "はっ。\n……あの、本当に聞かなくていいですからね！？", "zh": "哈。\n……那个，真的不用帮我问哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "e3255d08a47096174c5bc9554cb74d32ec7b030f1d7790c079ac6e3fcc2f479e", "ja": "変な勘違いして「代わりに聞いておいたよ」とか\n絶対やめてくださいね！？　絶対ですからね！？", "zh": "绝对不要瞎猜之后还跑来说“我已经替你去打听了”之类的话哦！？绝对不行哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "d9fe7819bf7c287162d259513a12e614b33e13952b2b8a9cda1ba9de591b6bd9", "ja": "大丈夫かな……。あの、とにかく、明日もあるので\n早く休んでください。約束です！　いいですね？", "zh": "真的没问题吗……那个，总之明天还有工作，\n请早点休息。说好了哦！听到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_526_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_526_rs_02_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "ae7f059fe7c3ffba11c10cbd48fa305f7d036a48284a0b6cc3cc9e913a2cd35c", "ja": "それじゃ、私はお先に失礼します……。コホン。\nおやすみなさい。", "zh": "那么我就先告辞了……咳咳。\n晚安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
